> Aggressive  needs CORBANU_HOME set to the real folder

Sensitive access denied by default, built from existing sandbox, approval,
network and exec-policy controls.
Aggressive cannot be chosen here. Corbanu home: it is reached through a link (/
home/user/.corbanu) in a folder agent commands can write, so a command could
replace it and the next start would lose Aggressive. Start Corbanu Terminal with
CORBANU_HOME=/home/user/dotfiles/corbanu (the real folder), or start it from a
folder that does not contain the link. Nothing changed.
